{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power of the Horde is an RTS with RPG elements. Heroes retain their inventories permanently, and all heroes and units feature skill trees. Players can command 3 factions, 9 unique heroes, and a diverse array of units in epic battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic RTS gameplay: Base building, unit training, and ability upgrades for both heroes and units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG equipment system: Heroes loot gear in every battle, and all equipment is permanently retained.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic maps: Filled with neutral guards, villages, and other distinct points of interest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Assistant System: Players can select different AI modes to handle base building, unit training, and troop control. You can even focus solely on hero control while the AI manages all other in-game tasks.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>(Upcoming Early Access Updates)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An MMO-RPG inspired grand adventure map: Heroes can explore freely, form guilds, recruit additional heroes, upgrade guild structures, and unlock exclusive bonuses for skirmish maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/d96ba7c8e42e99b0a70d5e93a789e507.avif?t=1769228423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras_big/d96ba7c8e42e99b0a70d5e93a789e507.webp?t=1769228423 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1298430?t=1769228423","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto